 data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/hd-mar14-300x300.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-402\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/hd-mar14-300x300.jpg 300w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/hd-mar14-150x150.jpg 150w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/hd-mar14-100x100.jpg 100w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/hd-mar14.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"100vw\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1bea5a1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1bea5a1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a14a18d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a14a18d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1f7c1ec elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1f7c1ec\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Blower</strong>, havayı veya gazı yüksek debi ve belirli bir basınç aralığında emip çıkışa ileten endüstriyel hava <strong>üfleme ve vakum cihazıdır</strong>. Endüstriyel proseslerin oksijenlendirilmesi, havalandırma, kurutma, basınçlı hava sağlama veya gaz tahliyesi gibi uygulamalarda etkin rol oynar. Blower’lar, fanlardan daha yüksek basınç ve daha kontrol edilebilir debi üretir ve bu yüzden HVAC, arıtma tesisleri, pnömatik taşıma, proses ekipmanları gibi pek çok alanda tercih edilir.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-94dfb27 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"94dfb27\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>✔️ Neden HD Marine Blower?</strong></p><p>HD Marine blower’lar:</p><ul><li><strong>Enerji verimli performans</strong> sağlar</li><li><strong>Düşük titreşim ve uzun ömür</strong> ile dayanıklıdır</li><li>Farklı <strong>debiler ve basınç seviyeleri</strong> için uygun seçenekler sunar</li><li><strong>Kolay montaj ve bakım</strong> yapısı ile işletme maliyetini düşürür</li></ul><p>Bu karakteristikler, blower’ları endüstriyel hava taşıma ve proses ekipmanı içinde güvenilir bir çözüm haline getirir.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3e36688 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3e36688\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3fdadf3 elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-tablet-position-inline-end elementor-shape-circle elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"3fdadf3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-table\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M464 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V80c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zM224 416H64v-96h160v96zm0-160H64v-96h160v96zm224 160H288v-96h160v96zm0-160H288v-96h160v96z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBlower Teknik Değer Tablosu\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cd1b156 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cd1b156\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"514\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"185\">Özellik</td><td width=\"329\">Değer</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Pompa Tipi</td><td width=\"329\">Endüstriyel Blower</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Çalışma Prensibi</td><td width=\"329\">Hava/Gaz emiş ve üfleme</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Debi Aralığı</td><td width=\"329\">100 – 2500 m³/h</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Maksimum Basınç</td><td width=\"329\">200 – 670 mbar</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Motor Gücü</td><td width=\"329\">0.37 – 25 kW</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Voltaj</td><td width=\"329\">220V / 380V / 415V</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Gövde Malzemesi</td><td width=\"329\">Döküm / Alüminyum</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Montaj Tipi</td><td width=\"329\">Yatay / Dikey</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Çalışma Sıcaklığı</td><td width=\"329\">-10°C – +130°C</td></tr><tr><td width=\"185\">Gürültü Seviyesi</td><td width=\"329\">50–85 dBA</td></tr></tbody></table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a9dc3e1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a9dc3e1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6a7960 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d6a7960\" d